#: ../../provisioning/kubernetes/helm_upgrades.rst:4
msgid "Helm Upgrade Workflow"
msgstr "Helm Upgrade Flujo de trabajo"

#: ../../provisioning/kubernetes/helm_upgrades.rst:7
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#: ../../provisioning/kubernetes/helm_upgrades.rst:9
msgid ""
"|morpheus| supports in-place upgrades of Helm-deployed applications. The "
"upgrade workflow uses ``helm upgrade --install`` semantics, allowing "
"users to update chart values, apply new chart versions, or modify "
"configurations without redeploying from scratch. This is handled "
"internally by the ``upgradeOrInstallApp`` method which ensures idempotent"
" operations."
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| soporta en-place upgrades de Helm-deployed aplicaciones. El/La "
"actualizar flujo de trabajo uses ``helm upgrade --install`` semantics, "
"allowing usuarios a actualizar chart valores, apply nuevo chart versiones, "
"o modify configuraciones without redeploying desde scratch. Este es handled "
"internally por el/la ``upgradeOrInstallApp`` method cual ensures idempotent "
"operations."

#: ../../provisioning/kubernetes/helm_upgrades.rst:11
msgid "Helm upgrades preserve release history, enabling rollback if needed."
msgstr "Helm upgrades preserve release history, enabling rollback si needed."

