msgid "Rolling Back"
msgstr "Rolling Back"

#: ../../provisioning/kubernetes/helm_upgrades.rst:102
msgid "To roll back a failed upgrade, you can:"
msgstr "A roll back un failed actualizar, you puede:"

#: ../../provisioning/kubernetes/helm_upgrades.rst:104
msgid "Re-run the upgrade with the previous values configuration"
msgstr "Re-run the upgrade with the previous values configuración"

#: ../../provisioning/kubernetes/helm_upgrades.rst:105
msgid ""
"Use the ``kubectl`` command line on the Cluster Control tab to run ``helm"
" rollback <release> <revision>``"
msgstr ""
"Use the ``kubectl`` command line on the Clústeres Control tab to run ``helm "
"rollback <release> <revision>``"

#: ../../provisioning/kubernetes/helm_upgrades.rst:106
msgid "Delete and re-provision the App from the original blueprint"
msgstr "Eliminar y re-provision el/la App desde el/la original blueprint"

