"para rollback."

#: ../../provisioning/kubernetes/helm_upgrades.rst:111
msgid "Best Practices"
msgstr "Mejores prácticas"

#: ../../provisioning/kubernetes/helm_upgrades.rst:113
msgid ""
"**Test with --dry-run:** Add ``--dry-run`` to Additional Helm Args during"
" testing to preview changes without applying them"
msgstr ""
"**Test with --dry-run:** Agregar ``--dry-run`` a Additional Helm Args "
"durante testing a preview changes without applying them"

#: ../../provisioning/kubernetes/helm_upgrades.rst:114
msgid ""
"**Use --wait:** Include ``--wait`` to ensure the upgrade only reports "
"success after all resources are ready"
msgstr ""
"**Use --wait:** Include ``--wait`` to ensure the upgrade only reports "
"success after all recursos are ready"

#: ../../provisioning/kubernetes/helm_upgrades.rst:115
msgid ""
"**Pin chart versions:** Specify explicit chart versions to avoid "
"unexpected changes from upstream"
msgstr ""
"**Pin chart versions:** Especificar explicit chart versiones a avoid "
"unexpected changes desde upstream"

#: ../../provisioning/kubernetes/helm_upgrades.rst:116
msgid ""
"**Incremental changes:** Make small, focused value changes per upgrade "
"rather than large configuration shifts"
msgstr ""
"**Incremental changes:** Make small, focused value changes per upgrade "
"rather than large configuración shifts"

#: ../../provisioning/kubernetes/helm_upgrades.rst:117
msgid ""
"**Monitor pod status:** After upgrade, verify pod health on the cluster "
"Workloads tab"
msgstr ""
"**Monitor pod status:** After upgrade, verify pod health on the clústeres "
"Workloads tab"

